<title>NORWAY: Norway's May PPI rose 0.5 pct mnth/mnth.</title>
<headline>Norway's May PPI rose 0.5 pct mnth/mnth.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics Norway issued the following economic indicator:</p>
<p> NORWAY PRODUCER PRICES     MAY 1997 APRIL 1997  MAY 1996</p>
<p> Month-on-month change	 +0.5	 -0.2	-0.6</p>
<p> Year-on-year change	   +1.6	 +0.5	+1.3</p>
<p> Index (base 1981)	    160.7	159.9     158.1</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
